==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Crabrawler|73}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Crabrawler|121}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Genesis|Electabuzz|33}} from the {{TCG|Neo Genesis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

